    {
      "text": "God through my life be glorified. Sing it! Let Jesus rise, Jesus rise. Come through my life, be glorified. Let Jesus rise, Jesus rise. Come through my life, be glorified. Sing it out. Let Jesus rise, Jesus rise. Come through my life. Be glorified! Sing him praise, praise, praise, praise, praise, praise, praise! Jesus, Jesus, Jesus, Jesus!",
